    `a temporary occupation permit is in force` IS FALSE
    `occupied solely to prevent damage or theft` IS TRUE

`living in an old house with no works` MEANS Occupation WITH
    `building works were carried out` IS FALSE
    `a certificate of statutory completion was issued` IS FALSE
    `a temporary occupation permit is in force` IS FALSE
    `occupied solely to prevent damage or theft` IS FALSE

